</li>
<li>
<p>understand the roofline model conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>distinguish latency-bound, bandwidth-bound, and compute-bound
          algorithms;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand cache blocking and tiling;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize vectorization and SIMD computation;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand dense linear algebra performance;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize matrix-matrix multiplication as a high-intensity
          computational kernel;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand sparse linear algebra performance;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize irregular memory access;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand matrix-free computation;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand shared-memory parallelism;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand distributed-memory parallelism;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize message-passing patterns;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>distinguish local and global communication;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand collective operations;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize reductions and broadcasts;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand communication complexity;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>analyze domain decomposition;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand halo exchange;</p>
</li>
