<p>distinguish host and accelerator memory;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand data-transfer overhead;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize kernel launch overhead;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand batch and fused operations;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize mixed-precision computation;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand iterative refinement;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize tensor and accelerator arithmetic;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand parallel numerical linear algebra;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize distributed matrix layouts;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand block decomposition;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize communication-avoiding algorithms;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand scalable Krylov methods;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize global-reduction bottlenecks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand multigrid scalability;</p>
