<p>understand distributed PDE solvers;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize parallel Monte Carlo;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand ensemble parallelism;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize parallel optimization;</p>
</li>
